// NR N should be non-increasing:
//   5m >= 10m >= 15m >= 30m
//
// FWD N <= NR N at every checkpoint.
//
// FWD FAV% uses only decisive forward outcomes (Fav + Adv).
// Both-same-bar and unresolved events remain tracked internally.
//=============================================================================


